# The traffic audit's account.
#
# Static, not DynamicUser: a dynamic user's StateDirectory lives under /var/lib/private
# (0700 root), where the alert follower, running as `archie`, could never read
# alerts.jsonl. The unit runs it with Group=archie, so what it writes (0640) is readable by
# the control plane and by nobody else. Capture rights come from the unit:
# SupplementaryGroups=wireshark lets it execute dumpcap (root:wireshark 0754 on Arch),
# and the unit's ambient capabilities are the ones dumpcap needs.
#
# Type Name             ID GECOS                          Home                     Shell
u archie-netwatch      -  "ARCHIE Sentry network audit"   /var/lib/archie/netwatch /usr/bin/nologin
m archie-netwatch      archie
